{"id":"3079644762048cc1","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-shellshadow.md","title":"Order-dependent shadows of positive term supports","display":"df-shellshadow — Order-dependent shadows of positive term supports","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-shellshadow","aliases":["27-df-shellshadow"],"display":"df-shellshadow — Order-dependent shadows of positive term supports","depends_on":["[[27-df-vardom]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§7.2.2 Definition 7.2","source_statement":"Order-dependent shadows of positive term supports","source_printed_pages":"332","source_pdf_pages":"356","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-shellshadow"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-shellshadow</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-shellshadow — Order-dependent shadows of positive term supports"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§7.2.2 Definition 7.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3079644762048cc1\" href=\"?note=3079644762048cc1\" title=\"Order-dependent shadows of positive term supports\">Order-dependent shadows of positive term supports</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"332"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"356"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 及布尔向量的坐标域见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=[n]\">\\(N=[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A:[m]\\to\\mathcal P(N)\">\\(\\mathbf A:[m]\\to\\mathcal P(N)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=\\mathbf A(k)\">\\(A_k=\\mathbf A(k)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sh}_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sh}_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_k\">\\(C_k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_k\">\\(U_k\\)</span> 的指标仅在下式中局部取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in[m]\">\\(k\\in[m]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sh}_{\\mathbf A}(k)\\coloneqq\\{j\\in N:\\exists\\ell\\in[m]\\;(\\ell&lt;k\\land A_\\ell\\setminus A_k=\\{j\\})\\}\\quad(k\\in[m]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sh}_{\\mathbf A}(k)\\coloneqq\\{j\\in N:\\exists\\ell\\in[m]\\;(\\ell&lt;k\\land A_\\ell\\setminus A_k=\\{j\\})\\}\\quad(k\\in[m]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_k(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i,\\qquad U_k(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in\\mathrm{Sh}_{\\mathbf A}(k)}(1-a_j),\\qquad\\prod\\varnothing=1\\quad(k\\in[m],\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_k(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i,\\qquad U_k(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in\\mathrm{Sh}_{\\mathbf A}(k)}(1-a_j),\\qquad\\prod\\varnothing=1\\quad(k\\in[m],\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>显式携带完整支持序列，避免把 shadow 误认为仅依赖单个支持。shadow 总与 A_k 不交，故 U_k 是非零项；第一项的 shadow 为空。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-vardom]]","embed":false},{"target":"Order-dependent shadows of positive term supports","status":"resolved","id":"3079644762048cc1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Order-dependent shadows of positive term supports]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[n]$ 及布尔向量的坐标域见 [[27-df-vardom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N=[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A:[m]\\to\\mathcal P(N)","display":false},{"tex":"A_k=\\mathbf A(k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sh}_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"C_k","display":false},{"tex":"U_k","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in[m]","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sh}_{\\mathbf A}(k)\\coloneqq\\{j\\in N:\\exists\\ell\\in[m]\\;(\\ell<k\\land A_\\ell\\setminus A_k=\\{j\\})\\}\\quad(k\\in[m]).","display":true},{"tex":"C_k(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i,\\qquad U_k(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in\\mathrm{Sh}_{\\mathbf A}(k)}(1-a_j),\\qquad\\prod\\varnothing=1\\quad(k\\in[m],\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true}],"bytes":1637,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-shellshadow|df-shellshadow — Order-dependent shadows of positive term supports]]"},{"id":"9bf4e8f79497e515","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m\\in\\mathbb N$。$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\mathbf A:[m]\\to\\mathcal P([n])$ 单射，$A_k=\\mathbf A(k)$；$C_k,\\mathrm{Sh}_{\\mathbf A},U_k$ 见 [[27-df-shellshadow]]。$\\mathbf C$ 为下式构造的项序列；$\\mathrm{Shelling}_n$ 见 [[27-df-shelling]]。"}],"outgoing":["4b84ee77aaf0c828"]}